---
kind: lore
id: diary
title: Sol's diary
---

/* The day is over (`dayEnd`, raised by the clock at the night slot before
   midnight). A heading, then one line for each person Sol saw today
   (`for="kind:person"`, 0.27), in member order. */

<beat id="day" on="dayEnd" title="Diary" priority="10" once="day">
  @sol{mono}: {{clock.weekdayLabel}}. {{run.postcards:plural(# postcard|# postcards)}} home so far.
</beat>

<beat id="person" on="dayEnd" for="kind:person" once="false" title="Diary: who I saw" when="run.seen[occasion.target] == run.day">
  <match on="occasion.target">
    <when is="ines">
      @sol{mono}: Ines. {{run.aff.ines:plural(# kind word|# kind words)}}, if I'm counting, which I'm not.
    </when>
    <when is="theo">
      @sol{mono}: Theo. Smelled of diesel again.
    </when>
    <when is="pell">
      @sol{mono}: Aunt Pell, all day, obviously.
    </when>
    <when is="mira">
      @sol{mono}: Mira at the post office. The machine is still haunted.
    </when>
  </match>
</beat>
